Package: axon-console
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Axon OS <axon-os@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: gamescope, steam-installer, axon-gaming-core, axon-game-mode, systemd
Section: games
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/ProjectDEV-git/Axon-OS
Description: Axon Console: a TV and handheld session for Steam
 Adds "Axon Console" to the login screen. It starts Steam's Big Picture
 (gamepad) interface inside Gamescope, with Axon game mode on for the whole
 session so the AI services stay out of the way of the games. Leaving Steam
 returns to the login screen.
